# A KairosChain instance, created by running the CLI with this directory as the
# working directory -- `kairos-chain upgrade --apply` here installs eleven
# SkillSets and projects Claude Code artifacts, all of it instance-local.
#
# Keeping it is useful: it is a working instance to test installs against. None of
# it belongs in a package repository, and two pieces must not be published at all.
# CLAUDE.md points at .claude/kairos/instruction_mode.md, which is the author's
# personal instruction mode; .mcp.json carries an absolute path from one machine.
.kairos/
.claude/
.mcp.json
CLAUDE.md
command.log

# Local config chosen by the installing operator, if edited in place.
# The tracked config/*.yml are the shipped defaults.
*.local.yml

.DS_Store
*.gem

log/
